You are performing a READ-ONLY frontend comparison and visual-contract audit.

FILES TO COMPARE

1. BASELINE / VISUAL SOURCE OF TRUTH:
   icm-pm-rapid-portfolio-review-v31.html

2. CURRENT INTEGRATED VERSION:
   rpr-step2-integrated-v31-v1.html

Also use rpr-step1-test-v6.html only as the frozen Step-1 reference.

IMPORTANT RULES

- DO NOT modify any file.
- DO NOT generate replacement HTML.
- DO NOT redesign anything.
- This task is comparison/audit only.
- Step 1 from v6 is frozen and must remain unchanged.
- For Step 2 onward, v31 is the authoritative visual baseline.
- The integrated HTML may contain newer backend/API logic, but visually it must remain faithful to v31.

PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

Compare the files and identify every meaningful difference from Step 2 onward, especially differences in:

- layout
- panel dimensions
- grid structure
- spacing
- padding
- margins
- card placement
- card sizes
- left/right column ratios
- Workflow Status sidebar
- Assessment Journey chevrons
- Step 2.1–2.5 sub-tabs
